  "title": "Spicy Zucchini Oatmeal Cookies",
  "description": "This spicy zucchini oatmeal cookie recipe is flavored with warm cinnamon and spicy cloves and packed with heart-healthy oats and raisins for a sweet treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Deb C"
  ],
